  "title": "CHARACTER VARIETIES FOR SL (3, C): THE FIGURE EIGHT KNOT",
  "authors_raw": "E. FALBEL, A. GUILLOUX, P.-V. KOSELEFF",
  "title_lines": [
   "CHARACTER VARIETIES FOR SL (3, C): THE FIGURE",
   "EIGHT KNOT"
  ],
  "abstract": "We give a description of several representation varieties of the fundamental group of the complement of the \ufb01gure eight knot in PGL(3, C) or PSL(3 , C). We obtain a description of the projection of the representation variety into the character variety of the boundary torus into SL(3, C).",
